      "core_clusters": [
        {
          "label_cn": "蹒跚步态；不稳的走路方式；（船/车辆等）突然上下颠簸；突然踉跄/猛晃/猛冲的动作；（比喻）突然转变；陷入危机/困难",
          "label_en": "an unsteady uneven gait; abrupt up-and-down motion (as caused by a ship or other conveyance); a sudden uncontrolled movement to one side, forward, or up and down; figurative: a sudden change, movement, or shift into difficulty or crisis",
