      "core_meaning_cn": "惨败, 倾斜, 挫折, 举步蹒跚, 徘徊；突然的踉跄、猛冲或摇晃；突然踉跄、猛冲或摇晃移动；（比喻）突然的变化、动荡或陷入危机",
      "core_meaning_en": "an unsteady uneven gait; abrupt up-and-down motion (as caused by a ship or other conveyance); a sudden uncontrolled movement to one side, forward, or up and down; to move suddenly and unsteadily, often to one side or forward; figurative: a sudden change, movement, or shift into difficulty or crisis",
